    ('e8fc9865-0331-44bb-96f2-417d131df4a1', admin_id, '744077f3-09b7-409f-8100-d2b2efa865e9', 'mcq', 'As per the 2018 IIT Kharagpur study, the Harappan civilization declined due to a drought of approximately how many years, beginning about 4,350 years ago?', '["500 years", "700 years", "900 years", "1200 years"]'::jsonb, '"900 years"'::jsonb, 'Driven by weak monsoons; based on sediment analysis of Tso Moriri Lake and Gujarat sites, indicating migration from urban centres to the Ganga-Yamuna valley.', 'medium', 'active', 69, '2026-08-02 19:19:39.950958+00'),
    ('9006fbf6-2a9a-4b58-a925-86ae18fe1115', admin_id, '744077f3-09b7-409f-8100-d2b2efa865e9', 'mcq', 'Under the theory of gradual decline, the reasons cited for the collapse of Harappan civilization include:', '["Aryan invasion and war", "Ecological imbalance and narrow-mindedness in the outlook of Indus residents", "Sudden earthquake", "Foreign trade collapse alone"]'::jsonb, '"Ecological imbalance and narrow-mindedness in the outlook of Indus residents"'::jsonb, NULL, 'medium', 'active', 70, '2026-08-02 19:19:39.950958+00'),
    ('a845b031-d9eb-4e39-88ac-663d2b7aaa73', admin_id, '744077f3-09b7-409f-8100-d2b2efa865e9', 'mcq', 'Which of the following pairs of Harappan site and its associated modern country is INCORRECTLY matched?', '["Sutkagen Dor - Pakistan", "Shortugai - Afghanistan", "Dholavira - India", "Mundigak - India"]'::jsonb, '"Mundigak - India"'::jsonb, 'Mundigak is in Kandahar, Afghanistan, not India.', 'medium', 'active', 71, '2026-08-02 19:19:39.950958+00'),
    ('21953be8-d371-47ba-a3c9-edababbce869', admin_id, '744077f3-09b7-409f-8100-d2b2efa865e9', 'mcq', 'Consider the following statements about IVC trade: (1) The Indus people conducted trade with Mesopotamia via the port of Lothal. (2) Sumerian texts refer to the Indus region as ''Meluha.'' (3) Tin was exported from the Indus region to Mesopotamia. Which of the statements given above is/are correct?', '["1 and 2 only", "2 only", "1, 2 and 3", "1 only"]'::jsonb, '"1 and 2 only"'::jsonb, 'Tin was imported into the Indus region (from Iran/Afghanistan), not exported.', 'medium', 'active', 72, '2026-08-02 19:19:39.950958+00'),
    ('7992d161-7e1c-4600-80b8-29e05ee3e303', admin_id, '744077f3-09b7-409f-8100-d2b2efa865e9', 'mcq', 'Consider the following statements on Harappan town planning: (1) All Harappan cities without exception had a walled Citadel physically separated from the Lower Town. (2) Chanhudaro was the only major IVC site without fortification. (3) The drains of Kalibangan were as systematic as those of Mohenjo-daro. Which of the statements is/are correct?', '["2 only", "1 and 2", "1 and 3", "2 and 3"]'::jsonb, '"2 only"'::jsonb, 'Statement 1 is false (Lothal''s Citadel was not walled); Statement 3 is false (Kalibangan lacked systematic drainage).', 'medium', 'active', 73, '2026-08-02 19:19:39.950958+00'),
    ('e6fa1ac6-3a2f-402b-8efa-6ee4712aab9f', admin_id, '744077f3-09b7-409f-8100-d2b2efa865e9', 'mcq', 'Which site is often cited as evidence that Harappans possessed knowledge of tsunami/flood-resistant engineering, owing to its stone construction and advanced water harvesting?', '["Kalibangan", "Dholavira", "Banawali", "Ropar"]'::jsonb, '"Dholavira"'::jsonb, NULL, 'medium', 'active', 74, '2026-08-02 19:19:39.950958+00'),
    ('4cea57cb-d8e6-4553-93f0-90c9bbd15e42', admin_id, '744077f3-09b7-409f-8100-d2b2efa865e9', 'match', 'Match the Harappan site with its associated river.', '{"left": ["Harappa", "Mohenjo-daro", "Kalibangan", "Lothal", "Alamgirpur", "Ropar"], "right": ["Hindon", "Ghaggar", "Indus", "Bhogva", "Sutlej", "Ravi"]}'::jsonb, '["Ravi", "Indus", "Ghaggar", "Bhogva", "Hindon", "Sutlej"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'medium', 'active', 75, '2026-08-02 19:19:39.950958+00'),
